    th_interest: 'Interest', th_liqs: 'Liquidations', th_memo: 'Margin wiped (memo)',
    yr_note_html: 'Each year runs on its own from a fresh $1 at the year’s first close; QQQ and TQQQ are the move from that close to the year’s last. The other columns are shares of the year’s starting value and add up: <strong>Hedged = spot gain + short P&amp;L + funding + fees + interest</strong>. <strong>Margin wiped (memo)</strong> is already inside short P&amp;L and fees: do not add it.',
    ep_h: 'Each crash and rally',
